      },
      "text": "AWK's niche: \"structured record processing\"\n    - Input has rows and columns (delimited text, logs, CSVs, TSVs)\n    - You need: filter rows + extract/transform fields + aggregate\n    - Too much logic for cut/grep; not enough to justify Python"
    },
